              "value": "Dazzling Blooms"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(visual)\n\nThe glimmervine shakes its iridescent blossoms to astound nearby foes. All creatures within 30 feet, except other glimmervines, must attempt a DC 21 Fortitude save. The glimmervine then can't use Dazzling Blooms for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is blinded for 1 round, then dazzled for 1 round."
